# Generated by xcodegen (`make gen`) — do NOT track. Xcode keeps rewriting these
# in its own scheme/project format on every open, which shows up as phantom git
# changes nobody made. project.yml is the source of truth; run `make gen` after
# cloning (or after any project.yml edit) to recreate them.
